AtmoGraph – Week 2

NLP & News Integration

Objective

To develop an NLP-based system that processes supply chain news articles, extracts important entities, and identifies supply chain disruptions.

Tasks

- Collect sample supply chain news articles.
- Implement NLP using spaCy.
- Perform Named Entity Recognition (NER).
- Extract companies, organizations and locations.
- Detect disruptions such as port strikes, shipping delays and factory shutdowns.
- Connect extracted entities with the Neo4j graph database.
- Update the graph with detected disruption information.

Technologies Used

- Python
- spaCy
- Hugging Face
- Neo4j
- FastAPI

Expected Outcome

A basic NLP system capable of analyzing supply chain news, identifying disruptions, extracting relevant entities, and connecting the results with the Neo4j supply chain graph.


